# The limestone caves, beside the first shaft down, at noon and at night: over
# the shoulder, then from the play camera; with the frame cost over five seconds.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/lands_caves.tour --seed=7 --realm=underground --view=shoulder --stats
coast calm
hour 12
wait 3.0
shot noon with land:limestone_caves
perf stats begin
wait 5.0
perf stats end caves-noon
walk 1,0 2.0
wait 1.5
shot walked with land:limestone_caves
hour 23
wait 2.0
shot night with land:limestone_caves
